; C array sizes: 10, 20
!0 = !{i64 10, i64 20}

; Fortran array sizes in memory layout order (column-major reverses dimensions).
; Source: real arr(5, 10) → Memory: [10 x [5 x ...]] → Metadata sizes: 10, 5
